  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A minor version for three things an accessibility audit found against WCAG 2.2 AA. A palette colour used as text now reads at 4.5:1 on the page and a surface in every variant, where MudBlazor's fell as low as 1.17:1; dark mode's secondary text reaches 4.5:1 on a surface; and a field's resting underline or outline reaches the 3:1 non-text contrast it needs to be found.\n\nWhat changed, and how to upgrade: https://github.com/FiliArrochada/Fili.Theme.MudAvalonia/blob/e10515c95e0a188c480c086a2cf95f5bc36dc6df/docs/versions/1.1.0.md",
